                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "可是，随着梦越来越长，\n时间叠在了一起，\n今天是昨天，前天是明天。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_204007401_446704812_content",
                "value": "可是，随着梦越来越长，\n时间叠在了一起，\n今天是昨天，前天是明天。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
